MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Echo Show 8 feels like a useful next addition to my Fire TV setup because it adds a screen for Alexa controls instead of repeating a device I already have.",
    "The smart plug fits my interest in connected home electronics and gives me a concrete new use: controlling a lamp with Alexa."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The HD Fire TV Stick adds little because I already have a 4K stick and a Fire TV television; sharing the same purpose does not make it a useful next purchase.",
    "Another camera interests me in principle, but my recent Blink purchase reduces my immediate need. The car Alexa device and USB-C cables lack a clear use in my current setup."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My Fire TV purchases seem to have been taken as interest in almost any Alexa device, although home controls matter more to me right now than car features or extra speakers.",
    "My camera purchases seem to suggest buying more cameras, even though a recent purchase may already meet that need."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "I care about whether something adds a useful capability to what I already own; I would choose the Show 8 without also needing a smaller display or separate Alexa speaker.",
    "Accessories need a confirmed practical fit: the memory card could help with my camcorder, but I would check compatibility and existing storage, and my history gives no clear reason to need USB-C cables."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my interest in connected home entertainment and monitoring, but sometimes confuse related devices with things I currently need."
}
